{
  "spec": {
    "title": "CSS Pseudo-Elements Module Level 4",
    "url": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "Element/pseudo(CSSOMString type)",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#dom-element-pseudo",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"Element\" data-dfn-type=\"method\" data-export=\"\" data-lt=\"pseudo(type)\" id=\"dom-element-pseudo\" title=\"pseudo(type)\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-element-pseudo\"><code class=\"highlight\"><c- nf=\"\">pseudo</c-><c- p=\"\">(</c->CSSOMString type<c- p=\"\">)</c-></code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-element-pseudo\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-element-pseudo\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-element-pseudo\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-element-pseudo\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'pseudo(CSSOMString type)'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#dom-element-pseudo\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-element-pseudo</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#ref-for-dom-element-pseudo\">7.1. CSSPseudoElement Interface</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#ref-for-dom-element-pseudo%E2%91%A0\">7.2. pseudo() method of the Element interface</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{Element/pseudo(type)}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog> method\n    is used to retrieve the <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#csspseudoelement\" id=\"ref-for-csspseudoelement⑥\">CSSPseudoElement</a></code> instance\n    of the type matching <code class=\"idl\"><a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"argument\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#dom-element-pseudo-type-type\" id=\"ref-for-dom-element-pseudo-type-type\">type</a></code>\n    associated with the element.\n    When it is called,\n    execute the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax-3/#css-parse-something-according-to-a-css-grammar\" id=\"ref-for-css-parse-something-according-to-a-css-grammar\">Parse</a> the <code class=\"idl\"><a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"argument\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#dom-element-pseudo-type-type\" id=\"ref-for-dom-element-pseudo-type-type①\">type</a></code> argument as a <a class=\"css production\" data-link-type=\"type\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#typedef-pseudo-element-selector\" id=\"ref-for-typedef-pseudo-element-selector\">&lt;pseudo-element-selector&gt;</a>,\nand let <var>type</var> be the result.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>type</var> is failure,\nreturn null.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>type</var> is an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#element-backed\" id=\"ref-for-element-backed⑥\">element-backed pseudo-element</a>,\nreturn null.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>type</var> is not a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#tree-abiding\" id=\"ref-for-tree-abiding⑥\">tree-abiding pseudo-element</a>,\nreturn null.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Otherwise, return the <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#csspseudoelement\" id=\"ref-for-csspseudoelement⑦\">CSSPseudoElement</a></code> object\nrepresenting the pseudo-element\nthat would match the selector <var>type</var>\nwith <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this\">this</a> as its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#originating-element\" id=\"ref-for-originating-element③⓪\">originating element</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}